MID_MV11_01: <SH>
MID_MV11_01_m001: Whoa there! Good birdie! Niiice birdie! Oh no!
MID_MV11_01_m002: Amazing, Cai! Awesome!
MID_MV11_01_m003: That was so great! We're gonna\nhave ornius eggs for days, guys.
MID_MV11_01_m004: I summon you.
MID_MV11_01_m005: Come to where I wait.
MID_MV11_01_m006: Hey, uh, did you say something?
MID_MV11_01_m007: Huh? Like what?
MID_MV11_01_m008: Like... "Come to where I wait"?
MID_MV11_01_m009: Huh?!
MID_MV11_01_m010: (surprised exert)
MID_MV11_01_m011: Caiii!
MID_MV11_01_m012: Caiii!
MID_MV11_01_m013: (surprised, alarmed yell)
MID_MV11_01_m014: (pained reactions and exerts)
MID_MV11_01_m015: Um... Who are you?